 r←GetDeprecatedBand comment
⍝ Returns the band that tells a visitor that a package is deprecated, as a vector of character
⍝ vectors, together with the comment given when it was deprecated, if any. A URL in that
⍝ comment becomes a link; see `LinkURLs`.
 r←⊂'<div class="deprecated-band">'
 r,←⊂'<p class="deprecated-label">Deprecated</p>'
 :If 0<≢comment
     r,←⊂'<p>',(LinkURLs EscapeSpecialChars comment),'</p>'
 :EndIf
 r,←⊂'</div>'
⍝Done
